## Always

- **Canonical homes:** C# → `MicroService.IAP/MicroService.IAP/.cursor/`; WebUI → `Web/WebUI/.agents/`. No duplicate bodies at analytics root.
- **Skills:** see [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) for model-invoked vs `@`-only. Build/test **execution** still only when user asks.
- **Build:** no `dotnet build` / compile after code changes unless user explicitly asks.
- **Tests:** no run after code changes unless user explicitly asks.
- **Terminal:** never dump unbounded build/test/shell logs into context — redirect to file, extract only pass/fail/errors (no read whole file back), prefer `--filter` / `--no-build`, delete temp outputs when done.
